OL,3,ANo collusion in sectarian killing but
OL,4,A'wrongful omissions' in police inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry into the sectarian murder of
OL,7,FRobert Hamill has found police officers
OL,8,Fwho were in a vehicle near the attack
OL,9,Fdid not condone or collude with the
OL,10,Fattackers.
OL,12,FHowever, the inquiry said there were
OL,13,Fmultiple police failings in the
OL,14,Finvestigation, including a tip-off to a
OL,15,Fsuspect to destroy the clothing he wore
OL,16,Fthat night.
OL,18,FThe report, published on Monday,
OL,19,Fhighlighted multiple wrongful omissions
OL,20,Fin the subsequent murder investigation
OL,21,Fincluding a failure to properly search
OL,22,Fthe home of a key suspect.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
