OL,3,ANo collusion in sectarian killing but
OL,4,A'wrongful omissions' in police inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,7,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,8,FPortadown, County Armagh in 1997.
